ransform="translate(77.83998680114746 198)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">80</text><line xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x1="89.83998680114746" y1="232" x2="385" y2="232" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.9"/><line xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x1="83.83998680114746" y1="232" x2="95.83998680114746" y2="232" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.9"/><text text-anchor="end" transform="translate(77.83998680114746 238)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">40</text><line xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x1="89.83998680114746" y1="272" x2="385" y2="272" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.9"/><line xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x1="83.83998680114746" y1="272" x2="95.83998680114746" y2="272" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.9"/><text text-anchor="end" transform="translate(77.83998680114746 278)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">0</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(24 172) rotate(-90)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Days</text><line xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x1="89.83998680114746" y1="72" x2="89.83998680114746" y2="272" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="122.63554382324219" y="78" height="194" width="32.79555702209473" fill="#666666" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="155.4311008453369" y="150" height="122" width="32.79555702209473" fill="#CCCCCC" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="188.22665786743164" y="195" height="77" width="32.79555702209473" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="end" transform="translate(181.74887935638426 291.84) rotate(-40)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">1980&ndash;81</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="253.8177719116211" y="117" height="155" width="32.79555702209473" fill="#666666" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="286.6133289337158" y="153" height="119" width="32.79555702209473" fill="#CCCCCC" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="319.40888595581055" y="168" height="104" width="32.79555702209473" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="end" transform="translate(312.9311074447632 291.84) rotate(-40)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">2005&ndash;06</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(237.41999340057373 24)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Days per Winter That Lakes Have</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(237.41999340057373 48)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Surface Ice</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(237.41999340057373 367.37955078125)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Winter</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" x="129.92708206176758" y="384.53955078125" height="103" width="155.14583587646484" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="136.92708206176758" y="396.53955078125" height="12" width="12" fill="#666666" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text transform="translate(158.92708206176758 408.53955078125)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> Ouluj&auml;rvi</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="136.92708206176758" y="428.53955078125" height="12" width="12" fill="#CCCCCC" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text transform="translate(158.92708206176758 440.53955078125)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> Mirror Lake</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="136.92708206176758" y="460.53955078125" height="12" width="12" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text transform="translate(158.92708206176758 472.53955078125)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> Lake Neusiedl</text></g></svg></figure><div class="sr-only" role="region" aria-label="Long description for bar graph titled Days per Winter That Lakes Have Surface Ice"><ul>
<li>For each data category, the following bars are shown:<br/>
